{"id":"u-a499b7ba-db76-4f7b-8008-ddb73337c962","src":"community","title":"Good Program","author":"Mirangel p","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/H7MsXX-untitled-program","desc":"plan is a 5-day split that repeats for 6 weeks, with mostly 2 sets of 6 reps per exercise. Day 1 covers chest and shoulders with barbell bench press, cable flyes, shoulder press, lateral raises, and tricep pushdowns. Day 2 is back and biceps, built around deadlifts, shrugs, lat pulldowns, cable rows, and two curl variations. Day 3 is legs with goblet squats, leg press, calf raises, and barbell squats at 2x10, while Day 4 is all core work like leg raises, sit-ups, ab wheel, and planks. Day 5 finishes with arms and upper body, including EZ bar curls, hammer curls, incline dumbbell press, and lat pulldowns.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-13T03:39:00.335Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Plate Loaded)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Calf Raise (Leg Press)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":120}]},{"n":"Sit Up","sets":[{"r":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Ab Wheel","se